# finetune, which is what v2 was and what lost). ADOPTED 2026-08-11 (prompts/flip_29.md),
# so the WEIGHT is now tracked and this is the LIVE gate; v1 stays tracked as PREVIOUS and
# nothing de-tracked. The five per-seed dirs stay working state.
#
# Beside the weight: `mining_gate_lock.{json,md}` (the frozen operating point the release
