# NOTE: docs/ is SOURCE ONLY — every file under it must be git-tracked
# (tests/test_docs_tree.py enforces this). Generated contact sheets used to be parked in
# docs/design/ and ignored here, which left tests/test_repo_size_guard.py permanently red
# on 4 uncovered multi-MB files. They now write to scratch/ like every other generated
# view; do NOT add a docs/ ignore rule to bring them back.
